<title>USA: Tower Automotive to list shares on NYSE.</title>
<headline>Tower Automotive to list shares on NYSE.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tower Automotive Inc said Friday it has filed an application to list its common shares on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>The company expects that its shares will trade under the symbol TWR, effective February 19.</p>
<p>Tower Automotive designs and makes body structural, chassis and suspension components, and assemblies for automotive manufacturers.</p>
<p>Shares of Tower Automotive were trading up 3/8 to 42-1/8.</p>
<p>		((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
</text>
